---
title: CatLium EduTech — Authorization Decision Chain (per request)
---
flowchart TD
    REQ["Incoming HTTP request"]
    AG{"AccessTokenGuard — valid JWT and active sid?"}
    A401["401 Unauthenticated"]
    TG{"TenantGuard — x-institute-id present and member active?"}
    F403["403 Forbidden"]
    RG{"RequiredRoles — OR semantics, optional"}
    PFG{"PermissionGuard — DB-fresh grant; manage implies action"}
    SC{"AcademicScopeService — resolve scope, enforce: Allow/404/403"}

    REQ --> AG
    AG -->|no| A401
    AG -->|yes| TG
    TG -->|no| F403
    TG -->|yes| RG
    RG -->|fail| F403
    RG -->|pass| PFG
    PFG -->|fail| F403
    PFG -->|pass| SC